# WEFT's twelve blocks: block 10 made on WEFT PATCH; B MOVES on WEFT BLOCK (black key 1); a twelve-block patch
# sounds; CLK OUT clocks another track's sequencer (CLOCK = WEFT); MOD OUT is the matrix's WEFT source; a patch with
# an output block keeps a voice running with no notes
wait 300
kind 1 6
wpreset 1 0
tap EDIT
wait 50
turn SELECT 2
wait 100
expect page WEFT PATCH
turn K1 1
wait 60
turn K1 1
wait 60
turn K1 1
wait 60
turn K1 1
wait 60
turn K1 1
wait 60
turn K1 1
wait 60
turn K1 1
wait 60
turn K1 1
wait 60
turn K1 1
wait 60
turn K2 1
wait 100
expect wtype 1 10 1
shot w12patch.png
turn SELECT 1
wait 100
expect page WEFT BLOCK
tapkey 1
wait 100
expect wbmove 1 10 1
tapkey 1
wait 100
expect wbmove 1 10 0
# DUST SKIN: ten blocks, heard
wpreset 1 10
wait 50
key 12 down
wait 400
expect meter_min 1 0.005
key 12 up
wait 600
# TICK CLOCK on T1 at quarter notes clocks T2; MOD OUT on T3 (A: ONE at 50) is the matrix's WEFT source
wpreset 1 14
wset 1 7 1 4
settp 2 CLOCK 4
kind 3 6
wpreset 3 15
wset 3 1 3 21
wset 3 3 3 50
wait 300
expect wvoices 2
expect msrc WEFT 0.45 0.55
tap PLAY
wait 2000
expect playstep 2 4
expect playstep 4 15
